# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
# Pro camera for the Moto G06 (lagos): GTK3 front end for camstream's control
# channel (tools/camera/camstream.c, started through lagos-camera).
#   - live preview (NV21 frames from /run/lagos-cam/frame), rotated for portrait
#   - manual shutter 1/4000..30 s, ISO 100..16000, focus (diopters / AF), EV,
#     white balance presets + kelvin
#   - guide lines (thirds, phi grid, diagonals, centre, 1:1 / 16:9 / 3:2 frames),
#     histogram, zebra (clipping), focus peaking, spirit level
#   - shutter modes: photo, timer (3/10 s), burst, long exposure, HDR bracket
#   - photos land in ~/Pictures/Camera; lagos-photo-enhance runs on them if ENH
#     is on (and merges HDR brackets)
# Runs as app_id lagos-pro-camera. Env: LAGOS_CAM_ROT=<rear>,<front>[,mirror]
# to override the preview rotation (degrees clockwise).

